    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Elizabeth Granato became Bureau Chief of the Cook County Bureau of Asset Management in 2022. She has about 15 years of public service experience involving procurement and budgets. She serves on the Planned Parenthood of Illinois Action Board.",
        "cites": [1, 2, 3],
        "sentences": [
